// Test effect of codol_assets: a looping smoke puff, a burst of sparks and a light. The materials are the game's
// own ( referenced by name ). Compile:
//   codol_assetc --install <game> --out codol_test_fx.ff --fx codol_test/spark_burst=tests/fx/codol_test/spark_burst.efx
